{
  "about": "The skill window's two views: a Wizard with 5 skill points opens the skill window (the tree), and the title bar's minimize button (skill_view) switches it to the simple list, one skill a row with a level up button, \"Lv :\" and the SP. skill_up:19 puts a level of Fire Bolt in pending (shown in red); Reset drops it. skill_view switches back to the tree, which is what the next session opens with. Ends a Novice with no skill points.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "steps": [
    {"say": "@job 9"},
    {"wait": 800},
    {"say": "@skpoint -9999"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"say": "@skpoint 5"},
    {"wait": 800},
    {"key": "Alt+S"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["Skills"], "state": {"player.skill_list": false}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "skill_tab:2"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "skill_view"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"player.skill_list": true}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "skill_up:19"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"player.skill_pending": [19], "player.skill_points": 5}}},
    {"move": [700, 600]},
    {"shot": "skill-list", "crop": [230, 70, 340, 420]},
    {"click_on": {"button": "skill_reset"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"player.skill_pending": []}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "skill_view"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"player.skill_list": false}}},
    {"key": "Alt+S"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"say": "@skpoint -9999"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"say": "@job 0"},
    {"wait": 500}
  ]
